ich inched up 0.1%. Among the biggest decliners, shares of Caterpillar Inc. (CAT) slid 1.2%, Chevron Corp. (CVX) shed 1.1% and Walt Disney Co. (DIS) lost 1.0%. Of the most active Dow stocks, General Electric Co.'s (GE) fell 0.4% and Apple Inc.'s (AAPL) gave up 0.7%.\n-Tomi Kilgore; 1003ET\n ", "external_links": ["http://www.addthis.com/bookmark.php?v=250"], "published": "2018-05-23T03:00:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-05-23T17:54:28.000+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}